aquinas-providence-necessary.logic.r2: argue/scope: P2 (S2): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, cause_pre ∧ follows_nec → □happens, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(cause_pre ∧ follows_nec → happens), C (S4) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
